   },
   "n": 1,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "10 min",
   "time_html": "<span>10 min</span>",
   "title": "Grate, salt and squeeze",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"400\">400 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Courgettes"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Fine salt"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Beat egg in a bowl, then mix in squeezed courgette, flour, cheese, dill and optional finely sliced spring onion.</li><li>The mixture should hold on a spoon, without liquid pooling.</li><li>If watery despite squeezing, add <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tsp</span> flour at a time, up to 2 extra tsp.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Mix a thick batter",
    "diagram": null,
    "diagram_title": "Diagram",
    "how": [],
