   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "4 min",
   "time_html": "<span>4 min</span>",
   "title": "Mix a thick batter",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-n=\"1\">1</span>",
     "name_html": "Egg"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"40\">40 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Plain flour"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"60\">60 g</span>",
     "name_html": "White brined cheese, crumbled"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"10\">10 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Dill, chopped"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"20\">20 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Spring onion"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat half the oil over medium heat.</li><li>Add heaped spoonfuls and flatten to <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"8\" data-b=\"10\" data-s=\"0\">8–10 mm</span></b> thick, about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"8\" data-s=\"0\">8 cm</span> across.</li><li>Fry 3–4 minutes per side, turning once, until golden and the centre is set, with no raw flour or wet egg.</li><li>Cook in two batches, adding remaining oil as needed; check the centre reaches <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"71\" data-s=\"0\">71 °C</span></b>.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
