   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drain in one layer on clean paper or a rack for a minute.</li><li>Serve hot with optional yoghurt and lemon.</li><li>If the outside browns before the centre sets, make the next batch thinner and lower the heat.</li></ul>",
